<title>INDIA: Bombay stocks-recent FII equity trading volumes.</title>
<headline>Bombay stocks-recent FII equity trading volumes.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover figures for purchases and sales of shares on the Bombay bourse by foreign institutional investors (FIIs) are as follows:</p>
<p>				  (in million rupees)</p>
<p>			  on May 7, 1997  total to date since FIIs</p>
<p>						 began trading in 1993</p>
<p> Purchases		    520		    178,600</p>
<p> Sales			  150		     76,860</p>
<p> Net			    370		    101,740</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				  (in million rupees)</p>
<p>			  on May 9, 1997  total to date since FIIs</p>
<p>						 began trading in 1993</p>
<p> Purchases		    330		    178,930</p>
<p> Sales			  200		     77,060</p>
<p> Net			    130		    101,870</p>
<p>Note : The above FII figures are provisional. Source: Bombay Stock Exchange</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
